    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1704212876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/0c606b2aed76eb700c635a95ba782d6a.avif?t=1704212876\" /></div><br><strong>Street Karate 3</strong> immerses players into an adrenaline-pumping beat 'em up experience where they assume the role of a fearless and adept fighter. Confronted with daunting odds, players engage in intense duels against waves of formidable adversaries.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/7de823c902d85735b27630bc8536793f.poster.avif?t=1704212876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/7de823c902d85735b27630bc8536793f.webm?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/7de823c902d85735b27630bc8536793f.mp4?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dynamic Beat 'em Up Action: Engage in exhilarating battles against multiple opponents, showcasing your martial prowess and adapting strategies to overcome challenging odds.<br></li><li>Immersive Weapon Utilization: Harness a variety of improvised weapons like rebars and knives strategically placed throughout levels, transforming everyday objects into potent tools of combat.<br></li><li>Ultimatum Strike System: Unleash a game-changing ultimatum strike to disperse adversaries in dire situations, but exercise caution as its use comes with tactical trade-offs.<br></li><li>Strategic Resource Management: Carefully manage healing techniques to maintain your fighter's endurance, ensuring survival through intense encounters and enabling progress.<br></li><li>Diverse Combat Techniques: Execute throws, jump kicks, and grabs to craft a personalized fighting style, enhancing your abilities and forming essential tactics for victory.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/d7a89fce6b02be1a1d5e86d02f6acb31.poster.avif?t=1704212876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/d7a89fce6b02be1a1d5e86d02f6acb31.webm?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/d7a89fce6b02be1a1d5e86d02f6acb31.mp4?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1704212876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/0c606b2aed76eb700c635a95ba782d6a.avif?t=1704212876\" /></div><br><strong>Street Karate 3</strong> immerses players into an adrenaline-pumping beat 'em up experience where they assume the role of a fearless and adept fighter. Confronted with daunting odds, players engage in intense duels against waves of formidable adversaries.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/7de823c902d85735b27630bc8536793f.poster.avif?t=1704212876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/7de823c902d85735b27630bc8536793f.webm?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/7de823c902d85735b27630bc8536793f.mp4?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dynamic Beat 'em Up Action: Engage in exhilarating battles against multiple opponents, showcasing your martial prowess and adapting strategies to overcome challenging odds.<br></li><li>Immersive Weapon Utilization: Harness a variety of improvised weapons like rebars and knives strategically placed throughout levels, transforming everyday objects into potent tools of combat.<br></li><li>Ultimatum Strike System: Unleash a game-changing ultimatum strike to disperse adversaries in dire situations, but exercise caution as its use comes with tactical trade-offs.<br></li><li>Strategic Resource Management: Carefully manage healing techniques to maintain your fighter's endurance, ensuring survival through intense encounters and enabling progress.<br></li><li>Diverse Combat Techniques: Execute throws, jump kicks, and grabs to craft a personalized fighting style, enhancing your abilities and forming essential tactics for victory.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/d7a89fce6b02be1a1d5e86d02f6acb31.poster.avif?t=1704212876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/d7a89fce6b02be1a1d5e86d02f6acb31.webm?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524340/extras/d7a89fce6b02be1a1d5e86d02f6acb31.mp4?t=1704212876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
